# P12 W4 (docs/design/sdk.md 13.3): Bricks. SELECT on its row starts a
# game: the first layout (eight rows of fourteen gel bricks, four colours
# by row) in a metal frame, the paddle at the bottom with the ball on it,
# the score, the level and two balls in hand. The wheel moves the paddle
# (the ball rides on it), SELECT launches, and the ball breaks bricks.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui-mod scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p12-bricks-start.script
# needs: modules
# reset: mainmenu

wait 4000
sdk_clear            # a fresh game
wheel +2             # Extras
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +4             # Games
wait 600
key SELECT
wait 1200
shot games           # the Games list, Bricks first
wait 600
key SELECT           # Bricks
wait 800
shot start
wheel -5 120         # the paddle left, the ball on it
wait 300
shot moved
key SELECT           # launch
wait 1500
shot flying
wait 2500
shot playing
quit
